```python\
def print_factorial(n):\
    """\
    Print the factorial of a given number n.\
\
    :param n: A non-negative integer\
    """\
    # Check if the input is a non-negative integer\
    if n < 0:\
        print("Please enter a non-negative integer")\
        return\
\
    factorial = 1\
\
    # Calculate factorial\
    for i in range(1, n + 1):\
        factorial *= i\
\
    # Print the factorial\
    print(factorial)\
```\
